---
import Full from '../layouts/Full.astro';

const appUrl = 'https://app.cazper.ai';
---

<Full>
	<div class="folio">
		<header class="topbar">
			<a class="wordmark" href="/">
				cazper
			</a>
			<nav aria-label="Main">
				<a href="#process">How it works</a>
				<a href="https://app.cazper.ai">Create an image ↗</a>
			</nav>
		</header>
		<main id="main-content">
			<section class="art-cover">
				<div class="art-copy">
					<p class="tag">IMAGINATION, WITH ROOM TO BREATHE</p>
					<h1>
						A little idea.
						<br />
						<em>
							Anywhere
							<br />
							you want it.
						</em>
					</h1>
					<p>Create an image through a conversation. Take home a transparent PNG, ready for whatever comes next.</p>
					<a class="cta" href={appUrl}>
						Make something with cazper ↗
					</a>
					<div class="art-note">
						<span>✦</span>
						<p>
							Start from words.
							<br />
							Or bring an image of your own.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<figure class="art-desk">
					<div class="paper-checker">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 360 430" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a translucent mint-coloured ghost">
							<defs>
								<linearGradient id="glass" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
									<stop stop-color="#c5f4d0" stop-opacity=".92" />
									<stop offset=".48" stop-color="#80ccab" stop-opacity=".3" />
									<stop offset="1" stop-color="#336d5a" stop-opacity=".8" />
								</linearGradient>
								<radialGradient id="shine">
									<stop stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity=".95" />
									<stop offset="1" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0" />
								</radialGradient>
							</defs>
							<ellipse cx="180" cy="390" rx="118" ry="15" fill="#234c3c" opacity=".12" />
							<path
								d="M64 328V174C64 31 296 31 296 174V328Q272 360 246 328Q220 360 195 328Q170 360 144 328Q119 360 94 328Q79 344 64 328Z"
								fill="url(#glass)"
								stroke="#fff"
								stroke-opacity=".8"
								stroke-width="2"
							/>
							<ellipse cx="111" cy="141" rx="30" ry="60" fill="url(#shine)" transform="rotate(28 111 141)" />
							<ellipse cx="141" cy="196" rx="14" ry="19" fill="#234c3c" />
							<ellipse cx="221" cy="196" rx="14" ry="19" fill="#234c3c" />
							<path d="M162 229Q181 252 200 229" stroke="#234c3c" stroke-width="5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" />
							<circle cx="112" cy="226" r="17" fill="#e6ae8a" opacity=".4" />
							<circle cx="249" cy="226" r="17" fill="#e6ae8a" opacity=".4" />
							<path d="m312 38 5 15 15 5-15 5-5 15-5-15-15-5 15-5Z" fill="#ad7858" />
							<path d="m42 250 4 11 11 4-11 4-4 11-4-11-11-4 11-4Z" fill="#ad7858" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<div class="paper-card">
						<span>SOFT EDGES. OPEN POSSIBILITIES.</span>
						<b>
							Let the background
							<br />
							be your choice.
						</b>
					</div>
					<figcaption>Transparency illustration · not a captured product result</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</section>
			<section class="conversation" id="process">
				<div class="conversation-copy">
					<p class="tag">MAKE IT YOURS, ONE CHANGE AT A TIME</p>
					<h2 class="section-heading">
						Good ideas
						<br />
						like a conversation.
					</h2>
					<p>
						You don’t have to get the first prompt perfect. Describe what you want, see what comes back, then ask for a
						change.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="chat">
					<div class="chat-line">
						<span>YOU / START</span>
						<p>Describe the image you have in mind, or upload a starting image.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="chat-line response">
						<span>CAZPER / CREATE</span>
						<p>One image with a transparent background.</p>
						<div class="mini-art" aria-hidden="true">
							✦
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="chat-line">
						<span>YOU / REFINE</span>
						<p>Ask for a change. Follow-ups edit the latest image in your chat.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="chat-end">
						<span>YOUR IMAGE, READY TO GO</span>
						<a href={appUrl}>Download a PNG ↗</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="possibilities">
				<p class="tag">OUT OF THE CHAT. INTO YOUR WORLD.</p>
				<h2 class="section-heading">
					One image.
					<br />
					So many places for it.
				</h2>
				<div class="card-grid">
					<article>
						<span class="possibility-icon">↗</span>
						<h3>Give it a new home.</h3>
						<p>A real alpha channel lets your image sit on the background you choose.</p>
					</article>
					<article>
						<span class="possibility-icon">↺</span>
						<h3>Return to an idea.</h3>
						<p>Successful image chats stay in your library, ready to revisit.</p>
					</article>
					<article>
						<span class="possibility-icon">✦</span>
						<h3>Find a little inspiration.</h3>
						<p>Explore the gallery, then start a conversation of your own.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
				<a class="cta" href={appUrl}>
					Start your next image ↗
				</a>
			</section>
		</main>
		<footer class="bottom">
			<span>cazper / a little imagination</span>
			<nav aria-label="Footer">
				<a href="https://app.cazper.ai">Open app</a>
			</nav>
		</footer>
	</div>
</Full>
<style>
	* {
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}
	a {
		color: inherit;
		text-underline-offset: 5px;
	}
	img {
		max-width: 100%;
	}
	svg {
		max-width: 100%;
	}
	h1,
	h2,
	h3,
	p {
		overflow-wrap: break-word;
	}
	h1,
	h2,
	h3 {
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	p {
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	code,
	pre {
		font-family: var(--mono);
	}
	pre {
		white-space: pre-wrap;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
	}
	.folio {
		width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 64px));
		margin: auto;
	}
	.topbar {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 24px;
		min-height: 100px;
	}
	.wordmark {
		font-size: 23px;
		font-weight: 750;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.topbar nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 25px;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: 12px;
	}
	.topbar nav a {
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.tag {
		font: 11px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.cta {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 30px;
		padding: 18px 25px;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 650;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}
	.bottom {
		padding: 35px 0;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 20px;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: 12px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
	}
	.bottom nav {
		display: flex;
		gap: 20px;
	}
	.section-heading {
		font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px);
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		font-weight: 550;
		line-height: 1.1;
	}
	.card-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 25px;
	}
	.card-grid h3 {
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}
	.card-grid p {
		font-size: 14px;
	}
	.icon svg {
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		fill: currentColor;
	}
	details summary {
		cursor: pointer;
		padding: 20px 0;
		font-size: 16px;
	}
	details {
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
	}
	table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		font-size: 13px;
	}
	th,
	td {
		text-align: left;
		padding: 15px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
	}
	th {
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	main > section {
		margin-bottom: 100px;
	}
	.source-label {
		font: 10px var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
	}
	a:focus-visible,
	summary:focus-visible {
		outline: 3px solid currentColor;
		outline-offset: 5px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.card-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		main > section {
			margin-bottom: 70px;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.folio {
			width: calc(100% - 36px);
		}
		.topbar {
			min-height: 85px;
			gap: 16px;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			padding: 20px 0;
		}
		.topbar nav {
			gap: 16px;
			font-size: 11px;
		}
		.wordmark {
			font-size: 21px;
		}
		.bottom {
			flex-wrap: wrap;
		}
		.cta {
			padding: 16px 20px;
		}
		th,
		td {
			padding: 12px 7px;
			font-size: 11px;
		}
		main > section {
			margin-bottom: 55px;
		}
	}
	.art-cover {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 55px;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 30px 0;
	}
	.art-copy h1 {
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: clamp(58px, 6.7vw, 91px);
		line-height: 1.02;
		letter-spacing: -0.06em;
		font-weight: 750;
		margin: 30px 0;
	}
	.art-copy h1 em {
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-style: normal;
		font-weight: 750;
		color: #637655;
	}
	.art-copy > p:not(.tag) {
		font-size: 18px;
		max-width: 420px;
		color: #657367;
	}
	.cta {
		background: #294d3b;
		color: #fff;
		border-radius: 100px;
	}
	.art-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 18px;
		margin-top: 25px;
		font-size: 12px;
		color: #667261;
	}
	.art-note > span {
		font-size: 35px;
		color: #b38b65;
	}
	.art-note p {
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.art-desk {
		margin: 0;
		position: relative;
		padding: 30px 15px 65px;
	}
	.paper-checker {
		margin: 0 20px 10px 0;
		background-color: #f1f0e7;
		background-image:
			linear-gradient(45deg, #e1e5d7 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(-45deg, #e1e5d7 25%, transparent 25%),
			linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #e1e5d7 75%), linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #e1e5d7 75%);
		background-size: 32px 32px;
		background-position:
			0 0,
			0 16px,
			16px -16px,
			-16px 0;
		border: 14px solid #fff;
		transform: rotate(-5deg);
		box-shadow: 0 10px 40px #394c3020;
		aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.12;
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
	}
	.paper-checker svg {
		width: 85%;
		height: 90%;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 20px #41684910);
	}
	.paper-card {
		position: absolute;
		right: -3px;
		bottom: 45px;
		transform: rotate(6deg);
		background: #f1dfb7;
		padding: 25px 30px;
		box-shadow: 0 8px 25px #62563215;
		width: 65%;
		border: 1px solid #e4d09f;
	}
	.paper-card span {
		font: 8px var(--mono);
		color: #775f41;
	}
	.paper-card b {
		display: block;
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 26px;
		font-weight: 400;
		margin-top: 15px;
		line-height: 1.15;
	}
	.art-desk figcaption {
		font: 9px/1.6 var(--mono);
		color: #5d6b54;
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		margin: 0;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.conversation {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 100px;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 45px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
	}
	.conversation-copy > p:last-child {
		font-size: 17px;
		color: #657367;
		max-width: 380px;
	}
	.chat {
		background: #e8eddf;
		padding: 30px;
		border-radius: 18px;
	}
	.chat-line {
		padding: 18px 22px;
		background: #fafbf7;
		border-radius: 12px;
		max-width: 85%;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}
	.chat-line > span {
		font: 9px var(--mono);
		color: #798671;
	}
	.chat-line p {
		font-size: 14px;
		margin: 12px 0 0;
	}
	.response {
		margin-left: auto;
		background: #cbdabd;
	}
	.mini-art {
		height: 75px;
		font-size: 55px;
		color: #6a8458;
		margin-top: 10px;
	}
	.chat-end {
		font: 9px var(--mono);
		color: #5d7056;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 10px;
		padding-top: 10px;
	}
	.chat-end a {
		font-size: 11px;
	}
	.possibilities {
		background: #ecebdf;
		padding: 45px;
		border-radius: 15px;
	}
	.possibilities h2 {
		margin: 25px 0 40px;
	}
	.possibility-icon {
		font-size: 35px;
		color: #809171;
	}
	.possibilities .cta {
		margin-top: 35px;
	}
	.card-grid p {
		color: #657367;
	}
	.card-grid h3 {
		font-size: 21px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.art-cover {
			gap: 25px;
		}
		.art-copy h1 {
			font-family: var(--sans);
			font-family: var(--sans);
			font-size: 64px;
		}
		.paper-card {
			padding: 20px;
		}
		.paper-card b {
			font-size: 22px;
		}
		.conversation {
			gap: 35px;
		}
		.art-desk {
			padding-left: 0;
			padding-right: 0;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.art-cover,
		.conversation {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 25px;
		}
		.art-copy h1 {
			font-family: var(--sans);
			font-family: var(--sans);
			font-size: 54px;
		}
		.art-copy > p:not(.tag) {
			font-size: 17px;
		}
		.art-desk {
			padding-top: 20px;
			max-width: 420px;
			width: 100%;
			margin: auto;
		}
		.paper-checker {
			margin-right: 12px;
		}
		.paper-card {
			width: 65%;
			right: 0;
			bottom: 65px;
		}
		.art-desk figcaption {
			font-size: 8px;
		}
		.conversation {
			padding: 30px 0;
		}
		.chat {
			padding: 20px;
		}
		.chat-line {
			padding: 16px;
			max-width: 90%;
		}
		.chat-end {
			flex-wrap: wrap;
		}
		.possibilities {
			padding: 30px 22px;
		}
		.possibilities .cta {
			font-size: 12px;
			padding: 15px 20px;
		}
	}
</style>
